WEBVTT

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.126
Why not personal biotech?

00:09:32.126 --> 00:09:34.503
If everyone in this room got involved,

00:09:34.503 --> 00:09:36.251
who knows what we could do?

00:09:36.251 --> 00:09:40.011
This is such a new area, and as we say back in Brooklyn,

00:09:40.011 --> 00:09:43.291
you ain't seen nothin' yet. (Laughter)

00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:47.261
(Applause)